Trust level restrictions (ZENITHDEV-200), engine side.
- Trust job-ability gambits need the ability at the Trust's main job level, or at its support job level
  (main-job-only abilities excluded), from the loaded ability data.
- When a Trust is summoned, each TP skill in its list is offered to the Lua hook
  xi.trust.canUseTpSkill(trust, skillId); a skill the hook rejects is dropped. With no hook, LSB behaviour.
  The rules (level 5 floor, gates, fallbacks) live in modules/zenith-public/lua/2-base/trust_tp_skills.lua.
- trust:hasLearnedWeaponskill(id) answers whether a Trust meets a weaponskill's normal skill requirement;
  trust:hasLearnedAbility(id) answers the job-ability check above.
- Corrects the reversed Stellar Arrow / Lux Arrow comments in mob_skill_lists.sql.
